          SparseSGD.Logistic.equilibriumBulk (r d)
              (SparseSGD.Logistic.familyPhi eta alpha (SparseSGD.Scaling.integerBatch scale sigma) d) ≤
            C * ↑d ^ (1 - sigma - alpha)
